    skos:prefLabel "GePRIS"@en ;
    skos:definition "Identifies authors by the first 2-4 letters of their surname plus numbers (e.g. XX 1234 or YY 67) generated by Elektra, the DFG's internal administrative grant-processing procedure. This disambiguation is for DFG's internal processes only."@en ;
    dct:source pidreg:uploadedInventory .

